\section{Conclusions and Future Work}

This benchmark demonstrates a reproducible path from heterogeneous ABL observations to modal initialization, closure-dependent Galerkin integration, model-selection metrics, and publication artifacts.

The sparse diffusion terms provide an interpretable reduced description, but the present spectral backend compresses much of the vertical diffusivity structure into low-dimensional response scales. Future work will extend candidate discovery to include dynamic scale-gap filtering, higher-order non-linear terms, and continuous multi-level profile calibrations.

